  skos:broader <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000007> .

<http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000009> a skos:Concept ;
  skos:inScheme <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/> ;
