  skos:definition "The organizations and individuals that serve as part of the military of a political entity"@en-US ;
  skos:broader <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000598> .

<http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000600> a skos:Concept ;
