  skos:definition "The scientific manipulation of living organisms and biological processes for scientific, medical or agricultural purposes"@en-US ;
  skos:broader <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000710> .

<http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000712> a skos:Concept ;
