  skos:definition "The study of celestial objects through direct observation and theoretical models"@en-US ;
  skos:broader <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000717> .

<http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000719> a skos:Concept ;
