  skos:definition "The study of the anatomy, behavior, origin, physiology and other aspects of living organisms"@en-US ;
  skos:broader <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000717> .

<http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000720> a skos:Concept ;
